                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Loomis to Mr.
                            Leishman.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-02-01"><hi rendition="#italic">February 1,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Loomis informs Mr. Leishman that the American vessels will depart
                    to-day.)</p>
